<title>USA: Intelligent Controls Inc Q3 loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Intelligent Controls Inc Q3 loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>SACO, Maine 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>NINE MONTHS ENDED	  QUARTER ENDED</p>
<p>			9/30/96     9/30/95     9/30/96     9/30/95</p>
<p>Net Sales	$7,108,800  $7,000,300  $2,839,100  $2,455,000</p>
<p>Net income	 (203,300)    274,200     (87,800)    104,000</p>
<p>Earnings (loss)</p>
<p> per share	    $(.06)	 $.08	 $(.02)	 $.03</p>
<p>Weighted average</p>
<p>  common shares  3,479,192   3,500,577   3,479,192   3,500,577</p>
<p>NOTE: The company attributed the loss to charges resulting from the writedown of obsolete inventory and from severance payments.</p>
